{"id":2850,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>考研在即，为助力学院考研学子以饱满的状态迎战考场，12月5日，人文社会科学学院精心筹备并开展“研路漫漫，与你同行”考研爱心礼包发放仪式，将学院的关怀与温暖送到每一位追梦人的手中。</p><p>礼包发放现场，学院党委书记孙俊伟和辅导员老师们亲手将爱心包送到考研学子手中。孙书记与同学们亲切交谈，鼓励大家要调整好心态，以最佳的状态奔赴考场。同时，他强调，要严格遵守考试纪律，诚信备考。学子们纷纷表示感受到了学院的温暖与关怀，他们定会带着这份祝福全力以赴，不负韶华、不负期望。</p><p>此次活动不仅为考研学子提供了切实的帮助，更彰显了学院以生为本的育人理念。未来，学院将持续关注学生成长发展，为学生的学业进步和人生发展保驾护航。</p><p>祝愿所有考研学子们，旗开得胜，一战成硕！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM8WIRnNCDnRQ2M5RCaLz-Zn7laU4lCinRL4oRlinz-8Lml0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ybM1hknSyYMR7DUmWVozV2LRUPMmWRUzTfnNnfn7U4MlVFMNnRolWknNQFMRVVUmCJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4vsgtA8pUQcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10777&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F96BE2416B2E91F04162CA9AFDADD35A/6DC9BBFF/41EB6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rozCI8nml8UNVRo57r7nmUYMllZU8rCfM4CiMm9DozVRL8L0gihFp2hmCIa0L1y8n1y8nky8MN-DMlLbnzAkLlUDLz9sLllPLNnVLRlPUlWFnR-PMRv4UzWFL4UZM7L4gtXaQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvsMYbw62Q8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10777&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM47IPLR78nzUDL5RvDMNQfMNQkM8LCYM4VkL8lsoRMfL7-0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkybn1hRoSyDUzLaLRUDMRlaUmARUmWRol7aUNCYMRCPolnFMzQknl-aLR6FMRNDLR-Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4vsgtA8pUQcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10777&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/09FC96A30046450B8CB2C9A0BF24619D/56BEB007/49602\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=roRCIsLR98LzUaL57WRM7lsU4Qfn7-C4Lz7iMl-PL4fkU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPMYy8nSh7nzLaM8Q7ozrfnzGiLRW2nNnfL7-aM7rfoRnFoz9iLm9bM8MFL4v4Mmf2gtXaQ4Oeo4xY6sAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRvsMYbw62Q8c&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10777&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rL47IYMzA2UNCbL58Q2M8WRMzARL7MC2M4TRMm-PLm7DMml0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7MSyaUYyaU4NPLRLiU4rknRCPLzTVMzTfLRT7n7CDMR6FMlW2oRMkU8rFMz9ZLzLJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aM4vsgtA8pUQcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10777&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CD50C0C91035C5BD6119E59A09DDF647/5BF83BCE/58813\"